This is the initial submission of svmfsmeta (version 0.1.0) to CRAN.

The package implements multiobjective SVM feature selection using NSGA-II,
with classification metrics, prediction, held-out evaluation, visualization,
and CSV export.

Test environment:
- Check date: 2026-11-16
- Windows 11 x64 (build 26200)
- R 4.6.2 (2026-10-29 ucrt), x86_64-w64-mingw32
- R-devel: R 4.7.0 Under development (2026-11-15 r90902 ucrt),
  x86_64-w64-mingw32
- Separate package libraries installed from CRAN for each R version.

Check command:
R CMD check --as-cran svmfsmeta_0.1.0.tar.gz

Results:
R 4.6.2: 0 ERRORs | 0 WARNINGs | 1 NOTE
R-devel: 0 ERRORs | 0 WARNINGs | 1 NOTE

The same source archive was checked on both R versions.

The only NOTE in both checks is the initial submission:
