This corresponds to the first CRAN submission of the package.

Examples, unit tests (1,303 passing expectations, with no failures, warnings,
or skips in each R version), and vignette checks and rebuilding completed
successfully. Both the PDF reference manual and the HTML manual, including
mathematical rendering, were checked successfully.

Checks were run on Windows only. Linux validation remains pending because
no Linux environment was available for this run.

